"body": "Fellow Greymanes,\nHere are the fixes and improvements that have been added this patch.\n\n## Update Schedule\n\nThe patch is rolling out across all platforms.\nPlease refer to the Update section below to see the state of the patch for each platform.\n\n### Update\n\nSteam (PC): Patch available now\nSteam (Mac): Patch available at a later time (in-progress)\nPlayStation: Patch available now\nXBOX: Patch available now\nEpic Games Store: Patch available now\nMac App Store: Patch available at a later time (in-progress)\n\n## Patch Details\n\n- Fixed an issue where the loading screen persisted or a black screen appeared when loading save data in certain circumstances.\n- [AMD] Fixed an issue where graphical issues occurred when enabling Ray Regeneration on a Radeon RX 9070 XT or higher graphics card.\n- [Mac] Fixed an issue where the game crashed when running the game on a Mac with MetalFX Denoising Upscaler option enabled.\n- Fixed an issue where indoor housing features were unavailable in Housing Mode under certain circumstances.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n- For known issues, please check the notice below:\n  - [[Crimson Desert Known Issues]](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=68)\nTemplate Start\nTemplate End\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment Start [버튼 배경 이미지 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)FAQ](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=63)[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)Report an Issue](https://pearlabyss.info/crimsondesertreport)\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment End\nWe are truly rooting for the journey that awaits you in Pywel.\nThank you!"
