"body": "Fellow Greymanes,\nHere are the fixes and improvements that have been added this patch.\n\n## Update Schedule\n\nPlease refer to the Updates section below to see the state of the patch for each platform.\n\n### Update\n\nSteam (PC): Patch available now\nSteam (Mac): Patch available now\nPlayStation: Patch available now\nXbox: Patch available now\nXbox on PC: Patch available now\nEpic Games Store: Patch available now\nMac App Store: Patch available at a later time (in-progress)\n\n## Patch Details\n\nTemplate Start\nTemplate End\n- Fixed an issue where the game would sometimes crash during teleportation through Abyss Nexuses or during combat.\n- Fixed an issue where the game would sometimes crash while hatching eggs near the Wyvern's Cradle.\n- Fixed an issue where movement could be blocked by small animals and certain effects.\n- Fixed an issue where some animals would not spawn.\n- Fixed an issue where filter categories would reset when sorting Mission Dispatches.\n- Fixed an issue where a Korean system message was displayed regardless of language settings when reaching a certain altitude while mounting a Wyvern.\n- Fixed an issue where the description of the “Sigil of Valor” item indicated that it could also be equipped by the Iron Eagle and Phoenix.\n\n## Known Issues\n\n- For known issues, please check the notice below:\n  - [[Crimson Desert Known Issues]](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=68)\nTemplate Start\nTemplate End\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment Start [버튼 배경 이미지 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)FAQ](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=63)[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png)Report an Issue](https://pearlabyss.info/crimsondesertreport)\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment End\nWe are truly rooting for the journey that awaits you in Pywel.\nThank you!"
