"utc": "2026-02-11T00:00:00Z",
"body": "The final episode of the Features Overview series is out now!\n[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2026/02/12/5dd4e24cc1220260212092551107.png)](https://youtu.be/BOy81crUgtw?si=srNjFhm_sEaTskHh)\nIn this episode, we shift focus to life between the quests and battles.\nFrom the Greymane camp that anchors your travels to the various activities that support your adventures,\nwe take a look at some of the things that shape your day-to-day life in Pywel.\nWe hope that the Features Overview series has given you a better understanding of Crimson Desert.\nThank you for watching, and we’ll see you soon in Pywel!"
