"title": "Crimson Desert Has Been Nominated at the gamescom Awards!",
"utc": "2025-08-18T04:20:00Z",
"body": "We're thrilled to announce that Crimson Desert has been nominated for the following categories at the 2025 gamescom Awards!\n  - **Best Visuals**\n  - **Most Epic**\n  - **Best Microsoft Xbox Game**\n  - **Best Sony PlayStation Game**\nIt is an incredible honor to be nominated, and it would not have been possible without our amazing community. As always, thank you for being part of this adventure with us.\nIf you’d like to support us, you can cast your vote in the categories Crimson Desert has been nominated for through the link below.\n[Vote here](https://www.gamescom.global/en/program/gamescom-award/user-voting)\n- **Voting period: (Wed) August 20, 0:00 AM - (Thur) August 21, 5:00 AM (PDT)**\nThank you for your vote and your continued support, and see you soon in Pywel at gamescom!\n[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2025/04/11/068f4a087d820250411070404147.png)](https://store.steampowered.com/app/3321460?utm_source=official_notice&utm_campaign=tga&utm_medium=gl&utm_content=notice&utm_term=notice)\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://x.com/crimsondesert_](https://x.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)"
